Your task: clean up the .axme-code/ storage in the current project directory.

## Step 1: Audit decisions

1. Read the index file FIRST: ".axme-code/decisions/index.md" \u2014 it has a table of ALL decisions with id, title, enforce, source, date. This is ONE file read, not 75.
